OL,3,GNEWSAWoman remains critical after fatal
OL,4,Apursuit collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman remains in a critical condition
OL,7,Fafter a police pursuit in
OL,8,FStratford-upon-Avon which saw one man
OL,9,Fdie and two women injured.
OL,11,FThe 19-year-old driver of a black Audi
OL,12,Ffailed to stop for officers on
OL,13,FBirmingham Road shortly before 17:30
OL,14,FBST on Monday, Warwickshire Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FHe was pursued by officers for about
OL,18,Fsix minutes before colliding with a
OL,19,Fwhite Ford Puma on the on the A439
OL,20,FWarwick Road. He was pronounced dead at
OL,21,Fthe scene.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
