OL,3,GNEWSAWoman remains critical after fatal
OL,4,Apursuit collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the Ford, a woman aged in
OL,7,Fher 60s, was taken to hospital in a
OL,8,Fcritical condition where she remains. A
OL,9,Fsecond woman, a passenger in the Puma,
OL,10,Fwas treated for minor injuries.
